cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the released artifacts, cite the paper below."
title: "IMPEdit: Inter-Modal Projection Editing for Knowledge Poisoning of Multimodal RAG"
abstract: >-
  Code and released artifacts for IMPEdit, an attack that edits the inter-modal
  projection of a multimodal retriever and injects poisoned images produced by a
  render-verify-rewrite loop.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
keywords:
  - multimodal retrieval-augmented generation
  - knowledge poisoning
  - model editing
  - multimodal large language models
authors:
